         MACRO
&LABEL   IOSCPA
         AIF        ('&LABEL' EQ '').S1
&LABEL   DS    0H
.S1      ANOP
****************************************************************
*                                                              *
*        IOSCPA PLACES THE ADDRESS OF THE CHANNEL              *
*        PROGRAM AREA IN CPAR.                                 *
*                                                              *
****************************************************************
.*                                                             *
.*       A DSECT FOR THE UCB (WITH PREFIX=YES), A DSECT FOR    *
.*       IOCOM, AND A 'ENTRY' MACRO MUST BE INCLUDED IN THE    *
.*       ASSEMBLY WITH IOSCPA.                                 *
.*                                                             *
.***************************************************************
         L     CPAR,UCBEXTPT-UCB(,UCBR)      UCB COMMON EXTENSION
         LH    CPAR,UCBCCWOF-UCBCMEXT(,CPAR) OFFSET FOR THIS UCB
         SLL   CPAR,3                        MULTIPLY BY CCW LENGTH
         A     CPAR,IOCIOSCP-IOCOM(,IOCOMR)  ADD TO CPA ADDRESS
         MEND
